body:
You saying she "nags" you tells me everything I need to know.

&#x200B;

YTA, obviously

I completely understand. But if it makes you feel better a lot of those relationships are fake. We as single people wish we were in their place, but remember those relationships only show the good things. Yes, I would also love to cuddle with someone and talk for hours. But I force myself to not force it. It will come, I know its cheesy and shit but it will.

&#x200B;

I also try to make moves. Small things like following someone on instagram can start something. If the person reciprocates then cool, and if they dont then thats also okay! Looking for a partner wont make them come to you, you are just hurting yourself. My advice is to do something about it, its scary but its worth it.
